00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,394
The Guardian reports that Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez has called for an urgent EU meeting after mass crossings into Ceuta from Morocco.

2
00:00:10,344 --> 00:00:17,844
He criticized what Spain sees as selfish and unlawful responses from some European partners.

3
00:00:17,844 --> 00:00:25,799
The crisis highlights how migration can quickly create pressure on borders, public services and EU unity.

